    <bpmn:process id="W_W5371" name="W5371. Dealer Floor-Plan Agreement, Security Agreement &amp; Collateral Perfection (Civil Code Pledge)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved dealer credit decision (W5370)
Frequency: Per dealer onboarding; renewal
Volume: ~300–800 agreements; ~1,000 active
Owner: Legal Counsel
Participants: Credit Manager, Dealer, Notary, Collateral Registry
Source: workflow W5371 — Dealer Floor-Plan Agreement, Security Agreement &amp; Collateral Perfection (Civil Code Pledge)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5371_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5371_Lane1" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5371_Lane2" name="Credit Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5371_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5371_Start4" name="Approved dealer credit decision (W5370)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5371_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5371_Task5" name="Draft the floor-plan/master agreement + security/pledge agreement defining the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Draft the floor-plan/master agreement + security/pledge agreement defining the inventory collateral, BuildRight&#x27;s security interest, and default/remedy rights.
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5371_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5371_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5371_Task6" name="Document the perfection requirements: possession/registry of the pledge (Civil…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Document the perfection requirements: possession/registry of the pledge (Civil Code pledge rules), and any third-party-claim notice.
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5371_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5371_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5371_Task7" name="Execute and notarize; capture dealer signatures and authorized signatories…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Execute and notarize; capture dealer signatures and authorized signatories (VS-88).
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5371_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5371_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5371_Task8" name="Perfect the security interest per applicable rules; record in the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Perfect the security interest per applicable rules; record in the collateral/lien register (W5379).
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Legal Counsel
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5371_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5371_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5371_Task9" name="Set up the dealer&#x27;s floor-plan account with limit, advance rate, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Set up the dealer&#x27;s floor-plan account with limit, advance rate, and curtailment terms (W5374).
Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: 0.5 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5371_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
