    <bpmn:process id="W_W5372" name="W5372. Dealer Inventory Collateral Verification, Floor-Plan Audit &amp; Stocking-List Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Dealer onboarding; periodic field examination
Frequency: Onboarding exam; ~quarterly field exams for larger dealers
Volume: ~50 onboarding exams/yr (per new-dealer intake); ~2,000–4,000 field exams/yr (the ~1,000 active dealers on the risk-tiered cycle)
Owner: Field Examiner / Credit Analyst
Participants: Dealer, Internal Audit (VS-21), TPRM (VS-161)
Source: workflow W5372 — Dealer Inventory Collateral Verification, Floor-Plan Audit &amp; Stocking-List Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5372_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5372_Lane1" name="Field Examiner">
