Responsible (R): Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per exam</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5372_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5372_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
