      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch (W5369); funding-line renewal
Frequency: Annual funding-line cycle; ongoing drawdown
Volume: ~1–3 funding lines; program exposure PHP hundreds of millions
Owner: Treasury Manager
Participants: CFO, Bank/Lenders, Finance
Source: workflow W5373 — Floor-Plan Financing Funding Source, Bank Credit Line &amp; Capital Allocation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5373_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5373_Lane1" name="Treasury Manager">
