      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5373_Start4" name="Program launch (W5369); funding-line renewal">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5373_Task5" name="Determine the program&#x27;s funding need from the dealer-limit roll-up (W5370) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Determine the program&#x27;s funding need from the dealer-limit roll-up (W5370) and drawdown forecast.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5373_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5373_Task6" name="Source funding: own balance sheet, a dedicated bank credit line, or an ABL…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Source funding: own balance sheet, a dedicated bank credit line, or an ABL facility against the floor-plan receivable/collateral (cross-link VS-170).
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5373_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5373_Task7" name="Negotiate facility terms (rate, covenants, advance rate against the floor-plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Negotiate facility terms (rate, covenants, advance rate against the floor-plan portfolio); execute.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5373_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5373_Task8" name="Allocate capital to the program; monitor covenant compliance (links VS-18 W319).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Allocate capital to the program; monitor covenant compliance (links VS-18 W319).
Responsible (R): Finance Business Partner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5373_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5373_Task9" name="Manage the funding-cost vs. financing-margin spread to protect program NIM.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Manage the funding-cost vs. financing-margin spread to protect program NIM.
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5373_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5373_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
