Owner: Treasury/Pricing Lead
Participants: Credit Manager, Merchandising (VS-39), Finance
Source: workflow W5375 — Floor-Plan Pricing, Interest/Markup Rate Structure &amp; Subvention/Manufacturer Support</bpmn:documentation>
