        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the floor-plan rate (interest/markup) covering funding cost (W5373), credit-loss assumption, opex, and target margin.
Responsible (R): Treasury/Pricing Lead
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5375_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5375_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
