Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5375_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5375_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
