Participants: Legal Counsel (VS-100), Credit Manager, Finance, BSP/SEC liaison
Source: workflow W5376 — BSP/SEC Lending-Company Compliance, Disclosure &amp; Truth-in-Lending (RA 3765) Setup</bpmn:documentation>
