        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm the regulatory vehicle and any lending-company/financing-company registration/reporting under the applicable vehicle: RA 9474 (Lending Company Regulation Act, BSP) or RA 8556 (Financing Company Act, SEC).
Responsible (R): Compliance Specialist
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: setup</bpmn:documentation>
