Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Compliance Specialist
Duration: setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5376_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5376_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
